# Screen recordings of runs show the terminal, and with it the home folder's
# path, which can't go in the tree (CLAUDE.md, Nothing personal in the tree).
results/*.mp4
# p24's screenshots of the sim window go in as JPEGs. Its four earlier runs'
# shots are uncropped and show the home folder's path in Devmode's Project
# Editor tab, which the user allowed on 2026-10-04 (CLAUDE.md, Nothing personal
# in the tree). A full-size PNG stays out.
results/p24-figure-*/*.png
# A record too big to commit, kept on the machine that ran it; a filtered copy
# under the plain name goes in instead.
results/*.full.ndjson
